// The playable classes. Edit freely: everything gameplay-related about a class lives here.
// Server and client both compile this file in, and its hash is part of the protocol id, so a
// client built from different numbers is refused at connect instead of mispredicting.
// Their order here is the order everywhere: the class picker and its number keys, the default
// pick, and the order target dummies come in.
//
// Units: meters, meters per second, ticks (32 per second), degrees.
//   id            stable key (also picks the class's look in the client)
//   max_hp        health at spawn and respawn
//   move_speed    walking speed
//   attack        the left-click auto-attack, aimed at the cursor (skillshot)
//     damage
//     attack_ticks  the whole attack (32 = one per second): from the click to when the next
//                   may start. Once it has gone off, the cast bar fills until then. A click before then
//                   is dropped (no holding fire, no queueing: click again once it's ready)
//     windup        how much of the attack (0 to 1) comes before it goes off: the spear leaving
//                   the hand, the blade reaching the target. You stand still with your aim locked
//                   meanwhile (see the README); moving cancels the attack (no hit, and you may
//                   attack again at once). The rest is the backswing: move whenever you like,
//                   cutting the animation short. Not shown anywhere: read it off the animation
//     kind: Melee(range, width, from)       a blow: hits everyone whose body a straight lane
//             `width` wide reaches, from `from` (optional, 0 by default) out to `range` from
//             your center: where the blade comes down, its hitbox (see the practice tools)
//           Projectile(speed, radius, range) flies straight, stops at walls/rocks/trees;
//             optional far_scale: damage after flying the full range, as a multiple of `damage`
//             (point blank), scaling linearly by how far the shot flew (2.0 = double at full range)
//     chill (optional): crowd control each hit applies on top of its damage:
//       (slow: fraction of speed taken away, slow_ticks: for how long, root_ticks: frozen in
//       place this long: no walking, no dashing, and a dash in progress stops)
//     rift (optional, melee only): (ticks, haste) each strike tears the ground open over its
//       lane (as wide and far as it hit, empowered or not) for `ticks`; its striker walks `haste`
//       faster (0.3 = 30%) while its body is in it
//     follow_up (optional, melee only): landing a hit empowers the next attack, if started
//       within `within_ticks` (and speeds up what's left of the attack that landed it, so the
//       next comes sooner): `attack_speed` more attack speed (0.6 = 60% more attacks per
//       second: its windup and its whole attack divided by 1.6, animated that much faster),
//       and (optional) its lane's far end and width `reach` times as far, its start (optional)
//       `near` times as far (`reach` unless given) (the weapon grows and smears out to match). Used up as an attack goes off (cancelling one first
//       leaves it armed): a miss loses it, an empowered one that lands arms the next
//   ability       the Q ability, aimed at the cursor: name, description, cooldown_ticks, and
//     kind: Projectile(speed, radius, range, damage)  thrown instantly: no windup, no root
//           Dash(distance, min_distance, ticks, damage)  dash toward the aim, through
//             fighters, cutting each one crossed for `damage`; stops at walls. As far as the
//             cursor, at least `min_distance` (optional: without it, always all the way) and at
//             most `distance`. Covers `distance` in `ticks` at normal speed (longer slowed,
//             shorter hasted).
//           Nova(radius, damage, chill)  a burst around you, at once: everyone within `radius`
//             (and not behind a wall) takes `damage` and `chill`
//     global_cooldown (optional, true by default): using it starts the global cooldown (1 s),
//       and it waits for it, like every other ability on it; false opts out
//   passive (optional)  shown to players, nothing more: Some((name, description)). Its effect
//     lives in the numbers it describes (far_scale, chill, crit...).
//
// Descriptions (the passive's and the ability's) can name this class's numbers in braces, filled
// in when shown, so the words follow a retune: {far_scale} (the auto-attack's damage after its full
// range, as a percent of point blank), {attack_slow} / {attack_slow_time} (the auto-attack's slow,
// as a percent / in seconds), {rift_time} / {rift_haste} (how long a strike's rift lasts / how
// much faster its striker walks in it), {follow_up_time} / {follow_up_speed} / {follow_up_reach} (the
// follow_up's window, in seconds / its attack speed / how much further its lane reaches, as
// percents), {crit}, {crit_vs_frozen}, {crit_multiplier} (as percentages),
// {ability_damage}, {ability_reach} (a thrown ability's range, a dash's distance, a nova's
// radius, in meters), {ability_root} (a nova's root, in seconds). A Q that deals damage must name
// {ability_damage}.
//   crit (optional)  odds (0 to 1) that an auto-attack hit you deal is critical for double damage
//     (a Q never crits): (chance: normally, vs_frozen: against a frozen (rooted) target). None by
//     default.
[
    (
        id: "revenant",
        name: "Revenant",
        role: "Duelist",
        blurb: "A spectral blade that slips between worlds. Gets in close and keeps cutting.",
        max_hp: 140,
        move_speed: 3.7,
        attack: (
            damage: 20,
            attack_ticks: 34,
            windup: 0.35,
            // The glaive comes down flat on the ground, its blade from 1.6 m to 3.08 m ahead.
            kind: Melee(range: 3.08, width: 0.5, from: 1.6),
            // The ground it hits tears open for a while; inside it the revenant walks faster.
            rift: Some((ticks: 96, haste: 0.3)),
            // Empowered: from 2 m to 4.4 m, 0.8 m wide.
            follow_up: Some((within_ticks: 96, attack_speed: 0.0, reach: 1.5, near: Some(1.25))),
        ),
        ability: (
            name: "Rift Step",
            description: "Dash toward the cursor, up to {ability_reach}, dealing {ability_damage} damage to each enemy you pass through.",
            cooldown_ticks: 256,
            kind: Dash(distance: 6.0, min_distance: Some(1.0), ticks: 5, damage: 18),
        ),
        passive: Some((
            name: "Follow Through",
            description: "Your auto-attacks tear the ground open for {rift_time}: inside the tear you move {rift_haste} faster. After landing a hit, your glaive is empowered for {follow_up_time}: your next auto-attack reaches {follow_up_reach} further and wider. An empowered hit renews it.",
        )),
        crit: (chance: 0.1),
    ),
    (
        id: "javelinist",
        name: "Jav",
        role: "Marksman",
        blurb: "Hurls heavy javelins. The farther they fly, the harder they hit.",
        max_hp: 95,
        move_speed: 3.7,
        attack: (
            damage: 16,
            attack_ticks: 28,
            windup: 0.3,
            kind: Projectile(speed: 15.0, radius: 0.25, range: 15.0, far_scale: Some(2.25)),
        ),
        ability: (
            name: "Spirit Spear",
            description: "Instantly hurl a fast spectral spear for {ability_damage} damage. No windup: throw on the move.",
            cooldown_ticks: 192,
            kind: Projectile(speed: 32.0, radius: 0.2, range: 13.0, damage: 22),
        ),
        passive: Some((
            name: "Long Shot",
            description: "Your auto-attacks hit harder the farther they fly, up to {far_scale} damage at full range.",
        )),
        crit: (chance: 0.1),
    ),
    (
        id: "frost_mage",
        name: "Frost Mage",
        role: "Controller",
        blurb: "Bends the cold. Little damage, but its frostbolts slow, its nova freezes, and it always crits the frozen.",
        max_hp: 100,
        move_speed: 3.7,
        attack: (
            damage: 8,
            attack_ticks: 26,
            windup: 0.32,
            kind: Projectile(speed: 17.0, radius: 0.28, range: 10.0),
            chill: (slow: 0.4, slow_ticks: 64),
        ),
        ability: (
            name: "Frost Nova",
            description: "Instantly deal {ability_damage} damage to everyone within {ability_reach} and freeze them in place for {ability_root}: no walking, no dashing.",
            cooldown_ticks: 224,
            kind: Nova(radius: 3.5, damage: 6, chill: (root_ticks: 80)),
        ),
        passive: Some((
            name: "Shatter",
            description: "Auto-attacks against targets frozen by Frost Nova have a {crit_vs_frozen} crit chance. Auto-attacks also slow on hit, by {attack_slow} for {attack_slow_time}.",
        )),
        crit: (vs_frozen: 1.0),
    ),
]
